{"seq":1,"slug":"subjective-bayesian","title":"主观贝叶斯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/subjective/subjective-bayesian","wordCount":2401,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"主观贝叶斯\">主观贝叶斯</h1><p>德菲内蒂在他 1970 年著作的开篇写了一句挑衅的话，大意是「概率并不存在」——他要抹掉的，是那个漂浮在世界之上、独立于任何人的客观概率。在他看来，概率从来只是某个具体的人、在某个具体时刻、对某个命题愿意持有的信念度，仅此而已。这个看似虚无的立场，却发展出概率哲学中最有活力、也最深刻地塑造了现代统计与机器学习的解释。它的核心武器只有两件：把信念度操作化为下注意愿的荷兰赌，以及把主观信念重新连回客观频率的可交换性。本篇是全 hub 讨论这两件武器的主场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-信念度作为下注意愿\">核心概念：信念度作为下注意愿</h2><p>主观解释的第一步，是把「相信」这个模糊的心理状态变成可测量的量。拉姆齐与德菲内蒂的办法是行为主义的：你对事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的信念度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，就是你愿意接受的、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的公平赌局的赔率。</p>\n<p>具体地，若你的信念度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，你应当愿意付出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 元买入一张「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 发生则赔付 1 元」的彩票，也愿意以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 元卖出这张彩票（双向下注，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是你认为公平的分界点）。这个操作定义把私密的信念转成公开可检验的行为，概率于是成了「理性主体愿意押注的程度」，而非世界的属性。</p>\n<p>主观主义因此获得频率解释永远得不到的普适性：任何命题都能赋信念度，包括「明天下雨」这样的单次事件（见 <a href=\"../objective/frequentism\">频率解释</a> 束手无策之处），甚至「哥德巴赫猜想为真」这样根本不涉及随机的数学命题——你只需问自己愿以什么赔率押它为真。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  BEL[私密信念:相信 A] --&gt; OP[操作化:下注意愿]&#10;  OP --&gt; P[信念度 p = 公平赔率分界点]&#10;  P --&gt; UNIV[普适性:任何命题都可赋值]&#10;  UNIV --&gt; SINGLE[单次事件:明天下雨]&#10;  UNIV --&gt; MATH[非随机命题:数学猜想]&#10;  P --&gt; COH{信念度组是否一致?}&#10;  COH --&gt; DB[荷兰赌检验]\">flowchart TD\n  BEL[私密信念:相信 A] --&gt; OP[操作化:下注意愿]\n  OP --&gt; P[信念度 p = 公平赔率分界点]\n  P --&gt; UNIV[普适性:任何命题都可赋值]\n  UNIV --&gt; SINGLE[单次事件:明天下雨]\n  UNIV --&gt; MATH[非随机命题:数学猜想]\n  P --&gt; COH{信念度组是否一致?}\n  COH --&gt; DB[荷兰赌检验]</pre><h2 id=\"荷兰赌论证-不一致必然稳输\">荷兰赌论证：不一致必然稳输</h2><p>现在到主观解释的辩护基石。凭什么信念度必须服从柯尔莫哥洛夫公理？主观主义不假设概率的任何客观意义，而是证明：<strong>任何违反公理的信念度组，都会让你陷入一组各自看似公平、合起来却必然净亏的赌局</strong>。这组稳输的赌局就是荷兰赌（Dutch Book）。</p>\n<p>举个最简单的例子。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与其否定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lnot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 互斥且穷尽。假如你违反可加性，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 赋信念度 0.6、对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lnot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 也赋 0.6。按你自己的赔率，你愿意花 0.6 元买「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 赔 1 元」的票，也愿意花 0.6 元买「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lnot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 赔 1 元」的票。你共付 1.2 元，但两票必有且仅有一张中奖、赔你 1 元——无论结果如何你净亏 0.2 元。你的信念度不一致，赌徒就能设计出让你稳输的赌局。</p>\n<p>反过来，德菲内蒂证明了荷兰赌定理的两个方向：信念度服从柯尔莫哥洛夫公理，当且仅当不存在对你的荷兰赌。于是概率公理不再是关于世界的假设，而是<strong>理性一致性的规范要求</strong>——违反它不是「猜错了世界」，而是「自相矛盾到愿意稳输」。这与考克斯定理从定性信念公设推出概率殊途同归，两条反向路径的对照见 <a href=\"../foundations/axioms-vs-meaning\">公理与意义之别</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>论证</th>\n<th>出发点</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>荷兰赌</td>\n<td>信念度 = 下注意愿</td>\n<td>构造稳输赌局</td>\n<td>违反公理 ⇔ 可被荷兰赌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>考克斯定理</td>\n<td>信念度的定性公设</td>\n<td>函数方程</td>\n<td>一致信念度 ≅ 概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表定理</td>\n<td>可交换信念度</td>\n<td>积分表示</td>\n<td>主观信念 ≅ 先验 + 频率参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>荷兰赌还有一个<strong>动态版本</strong>（刘易斯提出）：若你不按条件化规则更新信念——即观察到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 后不把新信念度设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\cdot\\mid E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——同样会陷入跨时间的稳输赌局。这为「贝叶斯更新」本身提供了一致性辩护，而不只是为静态公理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件化与信念更新\">条件化与信念更新</h2><p>主观贝叶斯不仅规定信念度此刻要一致，还规定它如何随证据演化。规则是<strong>贝叶斯条件化</strong>：观察到证据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 后，你对假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的新信念度应等于旧的条件信念度</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{new}}(H)=P_{\\text{old}}(H\\mid E)=\\frac{P_{\\text{old}}(E\\mid H)\\,P_{\\text{old}}(H)}{P_{\\text{old}}(E)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{old}}(H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是先验，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{old}}(E\\mid H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是似然，更新后得到后验。主观主义坦然承认先验是主观的——不同人可以起于不同先验——这常被批评为「任意」。但主观主义者的回应是<strong>趋同定理</strong>（merger of opinions，布莱克韦尔-杜宾斯）：在很弱的条件下，只要两个主体的先验都不把真相的概率赋为零，随着共同证据积累，他们的后验会任意接近。客观性因此不是先验给的，而是证据「洗」出来的。</p>\n<p>这套「主观先验 + 客观证据 → 趋同」的机制，是贝叶斯认识论的核心，其一般框架见 <a href=\"../../epistemology/scientific-epistemology/bayesian-epistemology\">认识论 · 贝叶斯认识论</a>。它也直接支撑决策论——理性主体用主观概率乘效用做期望效用最大化，见 <a href=\"../../decision-theory-philosophy/utility/expected-utility\">决策论哲学 · 期望效用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可交换性-主观如何重建客观频率\">可交换性：主观如何重建客观频率</h2><p>主观主义面对一个尖锐质疑：如果概率纯属主观、客观频率不存在，那统计学里「估计一枚硬币的真实正面率」这件事岂不是无意义？德菲内蒂用<strong>可交换性</strong>（exchangeability）和<strong>代表定理</strong>给出了漂亮的化解，这是本篇最深的一环。</p>\n<p>一列事件（如连续抛硬币）对某主体是<strong>可交换的</strong>，若该主体对它们的联合信念度不依赖于顺序——「正反正」与「反正正」在他看来同样可能，只有正面<strong>总数</strong>才影响信念度。这是一个纯主观的对称性判断，不预设任何客观频率。</p>\n<p>德菲内蒂的代表定理证明：一个主体的信念度对一列 0-1 事件可交换，<strong>当且仅当</strong>它在数学上等价于——先对一个未知参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 取某个先验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，再假定各次试验以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 为概率独立同分布，然后对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>前 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> 次中有 </mtext><mi>k</mi><mtext> 次正面</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{前 } n \\text{ 次中有 } k \\text{ 次正面})=\\int_0^1 \\binom{n}{k}\\theta^k(1-\\theta)^{n-k}\\,d\\mu(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">前</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次中有</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次正面</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.514em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.564em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 看起来就是频率派心心念念的「客观正面率」，但在德菲内蒂这里它只是一个<strong>数学记账装置</strong>——主体从头到尾只有主观信念度，客观频率参数是他可交换信念的一个等价表示，而非世界里真实存在的量。更妙的是，随着观测增多，先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 会集中到观测频率附近，主体的预测收敛到频率派会给的值。于是<strong>主观主义在完全不承认客观概率的前提下，重建了频率参数的全部实用功能</strong>。可交换性因此是主观阵营对客观阵营（见 <a href=\"../objective/frequentism\">频率解释</a>）最有力的回应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EX[可交换信念度&lt;br/&gt;只看总数不看顺序] --&gt; REP[德菲内蒂代表定理]&#10;  REP --&gt; INT[等价于:先验 mu on theta&lt;br/&gt;加 以 theta 独立同分布]&#10;  INT --&gt; THETA[参数 theta 貌似 客观频率]&#10;  THETA --&gt; ACT[真相:theta 只是记账装置&lt;br/&gt;主体只有主观信念]&#10;  INT --&gt; CONV[观测增多 到 mu 集中于观测频率]&#10;  CONV --&gt; RECON[主观主义重建频率的实用功能&lt;br/&gt;无需客观概率]\">flowchart TD\n  EX[可交换信念度&lt;br/&gt;只看总数不看顺序] --&gt; REP[德菲内蒂代表定理]\n  REP --&gt; INT[等价于:先验 mu on theta&lt;br/&gt;加 以 theta 独立同分布]\n  INT --&gt; THETA[参数 theta 貌似 客观频率]\n  THETA --&gt; ACT[真相:theta 只是记账装置&lt;br/&gt;主体只有主观信念]\n  INT --&gt; CONV[观测增多 到 mu 集中于观测频率]\n  CONV --&gt; RECON[主观主义重建频率的实用功能&lt;br/&gt;无需客观概率]</pre><h2 id=\"主观主义的边界与批评\">主观主义的边界与批评</h2><p>主观贝叶斯并非终点，它有真实的软肋，理解它们才知道为何还需要逻辑概率与主要原则。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>先验任意性在小样本下不消失</strong>：趋同定理是渐近的，证据稀少时不同先验给出显著不同的后验，「主观」的批评在此有效。卡尔纳普的逻辑概率正是想通过给出唯一客观先验来根治这一点，其成败见 <a href=\"logical-probability\">逻辑概率</a>。其二，<strong>旧证据问题</strong>（Glymour）：对早已知道的证据，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(E)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，贝叶斯条件化无法解释它为何还能确证新理论。其三，<strong>它没说信念度该向什么看齐</strong>：荷兰赌只保证内部一致，却不保证你的信念度与世界的客观机会吻合——一个内部一致但把公平硬币信念度设为 0.99 的人不违反任何主观规范。要修补这一点，就需要一条把主观信念锚定到客观机会的原则，那正是刘易斯的 <a href=\"principal-principle\">主要原则</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>主观贝叶斯（拉姆齐、德菲内蒂）把概率等同于理性主体的信念度，操作化为下注意愿，从而适用于任何命题，包括单次事件与非随机的数学命题。</li>\n<li><strong>荷兰赌论证</strong>（本篇主场）：违反柯尔莫哥洛夫公理的信念度组必然可被构造成稳输赌局；服从公理当且仅当不可被荷兰赌——概率公理是理性一致性的规范要求。</li>\n<li>信念随证据按贝叶斯条件化更新；先验虽主观，但趋同定理保证证据积累使不同主体的后验任意接近。</li>\n<li><strong>可交换性与代表定理</strong>（本篇主场）：可交换信念度等价于「先验 + 独立同分布频率参数」，主观主义借此在不承认客观概率的前提下重建频率的全部实用功能。</li>\n<li>软肋：小样本下先验任意性不消失、旧证据问题、以及信念度不保证向客观机会看齐——后者需主要原则来锚定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../foundations/axioms-vs-meaning\">公理与意义之别</a>（荷兰赌反推公理）、<a href=\"logical-probability\">逻辑概率</a>（消除先验任意性的尝试）、<a href=\"principal-principle\">主要原则</a>（信念向机会看齐）、<a href=\"../objective/frequentism\">频率解释</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../epistemology/scientific-epistemology/bayesian-epistemology\">认识论 · 贝叶斯认识论</a>、<a href=\"../../decision-theory-philosophy/utility/expected-utility\">决策论哲学 · 期望效用</a>（主观概率驱动理性选择）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主观贝叶斯","id":"主观贝叶斯"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：信念度作为下注意愿","id":"核心概念-信念度作为下注意愿"},{"level":2,"text":"荷兰赌论证：不一致必然稳输","id":"荷兰赌论证-不一致必然稳输"},{"level":2,"text":"条件化与信念更新","id":"条件化与信念更新"},{"level":2,"text":"可交换性：主观如何重建客观频率","id":"可交换性-主观如何重建客观频率"},{"level":2,"text":"主观主义的边界与批评","id":"主观主义的边界与批评"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"最佳系统解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/objective/best-system"},"next":{"title":"逻辑概率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/subjective/logical-probability"}}